       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MANHATTAN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 X1 PIC S9(3) VALUE 1.
       01 Y1 PIC S9(3) VALUE 2.
       01 X2 PIC S9(3) VALUE 4.
       01 Y2 PIC S9(3) VALUE 6.
       01 DIST PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE DIST = FUNCTION ABS(X1 - X2) + FUNCTION ABS(Y1 - Y2)
           DISPLAY DIST
           STOP RUN.
